## The far jetty

::bg{location="lakeshore" time="night"}
::music{action="start" mood="sad" volume="down"}
::auto{character="hotaru" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
@hotaru{emotion="smiling"}: A date. With the lantern keeper. The headmistress would faint.
@hotaru{emotion="sad"}: I was a student here, in 1931. I floated my lantern on my own. It came back. I stayed to keep it company. Then I kept all of them.
@hotaru{emotion="fond"}: You've floated one with Ren, and Mika, and Soren, and Kai. I watched every one come home to me. You're the only one who keeps coming back too.

::date{with="hotaru" spot="lakeshore" resultKey="keeper"}

<match on="scene.date.keeper.mood">
  <when is="awkward">
    @hotaru{emotion="neutral"}: It's all right. I haven't been on a date in ninety-five years. I'm also bad at it.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @hotaru{emotion="smiling"}: Oh. So that's what it's for. The hand-holding. I always wondered.
  </otherwise>
</match>
